  "title": "RESERVOIR TALENT CONTRIBUTE TO TWO 2026 VMA NOMINATIONS",
  "summary": "Nominations for the 2026 MTV Video Music Awards have been announced. Reservoir talent have contributed to two nominations, including: Best R&B“Yukon” by Justin Bieber, co-written by 2 Chainz“Folded” by Kehlani, co-written/co-produced by Khris Riddick-Tynes Voting is open now, and the VMAs will broadcast live from the Peacock Theatre in Los Angeles on Sunday, September 27th at […]",
